  "css_summary": "【抽出カラー（頻度順）】\n  #2E404D  background  出現483回  [external-css]\n  #070F26  border-bottom  出現384回  [external-css]\n  #FFC400  border-bottom  出現240回  [external-css]\n  #E8E8E8  border-bottom  出現218回  [external-css]\n  #0072BC  color  出現192回  [external-css]\n  #949494  border  出現179回  [external-css]\n  #005B96  background  出現123回  [external-css]\n  #E42600  color  出現39回  [external-css]\n  #F2F3F4  background  出現33回  [external-css]\n  #141B31  background  出現24回  [external-css]\n  #EEEEEE  border-color  出現14回  [external-css]\n  #515767  color  出現9回  [external-css]\n  #19A3FC  color  出現9回  [external-css]\n  #696B75  border  出現9回  [external-css]\n  #3176F6  border-color  出現9回  [external-css]\n\n【使用フォント】\n  var(--fa-style-family\n  Font Awesome 6 Brands\n  Font Awesome 6 Free\n  Font Awesome 5 Brands\n  Font Awesome 5 Free\n  FontAwesome\n  Noto Sans\n  Noto Serif\n  swiper-icons\n  object-fit: cover\n  Lato!important\n  Noto Sans JP\n  sans-serif\n\n【角丸パターン】\n  var(--fa-border-radius,.1em)\n  6px\n  .375rem\n  .375rem!important\n  12px\n  50%\n  40px\n  4px\n\n【ボタンスタイル】\n  ★ .c-btn-arrow（実際のボタン要素で1回使用）\n    display: inline-flex!important\n    align-items: center\n    border: 1px solid #fff\n    padding: 5px 40px\n    background: 0 0\n    min-height: 64px\n  ★ .c-btn.c-btn--sm.c-filter-checkbox（実際のボタン要素で3回使用）\n    color: #070f26\n    border: 1px solid #070f26\n    font-weight: 700\n    padding: 5px 20px\n    min-height: 40px\n    font-size: 1.4rem\n  ★ .c-btn-important-arrow（実際のボタン要素で5回使用）\n    color: #fff\n    display: inline-flex!important\n    align-items: center\n    border: none\n    padding: 5px 40px\n    background: #0072bc\n  ★ .c-btn-important.c-btn-important--sm.js-filter-button（実際のボタン要素で1回使用）\n    display: inline-flex\n    align-items: center\n    border: none\n    padding: 5px 20px\n    background: #0072bc\n    min-height: 40px\n  ★ .c-link-share-button.st-custom-button（実際のボタン要素で3回使用）\n    border-radius: 50%\n    background-color: #fff\n    background-repeat: no-repeat\n    background-position: center center\n    background-size: 24px 24px\n    box-shadow: 8px 8px 15px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\n\n【カードスタイル】\n  .countryInitialModal-body .tab-content .container-card::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb\n    border-radius: 6px\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,.6)\n  .countryInitialModal-body .tab-content .container-card .card\n    border-radius: 6px\n  .countryInitialModal-body .tab-content .container-card .card:hover\n    background: linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(46,64,77,.6) 0,rgba(46,64,77,.6) 100%),#070f26\n  .countryInitialModal-body .tab-content .container-card::-webkit-scrollbar\n    background: #070f26\n    width: 12px\n  .country-selector-modal.is-global .opCos-Cntr a::after,.countryInitialModal-body .tab-content .container-card .card__footer a::after\n    display: inline-block\n    flex: none\n    background: url(/jp/ja/-/media/assets/images/icon/yellow/arrow_right.svg) no-repeat\n    background-size: 100%\n    width: 16px\n    height: 16px\n\n【フォームスタイル】\n  .new_countrySelect-inputArea input#inputCountry\n    width: 100%\n    padding: 0 24px\n    height: 65px\n    background-color: #070f26\n    color: #fff\n    border-radius: .375rem\n  .new_countrySelect-OpcosCurrentSelect\n    width: 92%\n    color: #fff\n    font-size: 16px\n    border-radius: .375rem\n    border: 1px solid #fff\n    background: #2e404d\n  .c-input-text-type-b\n    border: 1px solid #949494\n    border-radius: 4px\n    padding: 13px 8px\n    background: #fff\n    width: 100%\n    color: #070f26!important\n  .c-select-type-b select\n    border: 1px solid #949494\n    border-radius: 4px\n    padding: 13px 48px 13px 8px\n    background: 0 0\n    color: #949494\n    width: 100%\n  .p-lineup-article-listing .c-list-filter-select>dd>input\n    width: 60%\n    border: 1px solid #949494\n    border-radius: 4px\n    padding: 13px 8px\n    background: #fff\n    color: #070f26!important\n\n【ロゴ・ビジュアル素材】\n  https://www.nttdata.com/global/ja/-/media/assets/images/sns